### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Root Route - API Information
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET /books - All Books (Default query params: order_by=id ASC, limit=10, offset=0)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/
Accept: application/json

### 3. GET /books - Text Search Filter (search_q=Python)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?search_q=Python
Accept: application/json

### 4. GET /books - Sort by Price Descending (order_by=price&order=DESC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?order_by=price&order=DESC
Accept: application/json

### 5. GET /books - Price Range Filter (min_price=500&max_price=1000)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?min_price=500&max_price=1000
Accept: application/json

### 6. GET /books - Pagination (limit=3&offset=3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?limit=3&offset=3
Accept: application/json

### 7. GET /books - Combined Search, Filter, Sort & Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?search_q=o&order_by=price&order=ASC&min_price=400&max_price=1200&limit=4&offset=0
Accept: application/json

### 8. GET /books/:bookId - Single Book (Success: 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1/
Accept: application/json

### 9. GET /books/:bookId - Single Book Not Found (Failure: 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/999/
Accept: application/json

### 10. POST /books - Add New Book (Success: 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Designing Data-Intensive Applications",
  "author": "Martin Kleppmann",
  "price": 1450,
  "pages": 616
}

### 11. POST /books - Validation Error: Missing Title (Failure: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "price": 650,
  "pages": 464
}

### 12. POST /books - Validation Error: Non-numeric Price (Failure: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Architecture",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "price": "five-hundred",
  "pages": 432
}

### 13. PUT /books/:bookId - Update Existing Book (Success: 200 OK)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Atomic Habits (Hardcover Edition)",
  "author": "James Clear",
  "price": 599,
  "pages": 320
}

### 14. PUT /books/:bookId - Update Non-existent Book (Failure: 404 Not Found)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/999/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ghost Book",
  "author": "Anonymous",
  "price": 999,
  "pages": 100
}

### 15. DELETE /books/:bookId - Delete Book (Success: 200 OK)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/11/
Accept: application/json

### 16. DELETE /books/:bookId - Delete Non-existent Book (Failure: 404 Not Found)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/999/
Accept: application/json

